# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CVE-2026-56854 - golang.org/x/crypto/ssh, added 2026-09-01
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Authentication bypass: the source-address restriction in Permissions was not
# enforced for the PasswordCallback, KeyboardInteractiveCallback,
# NoClientAuthCallback and GSSAPI login paths. Rated CRITICAL.
#
# It is a vulnerability in an SSH *server*. Caddy is an HTTP/TLS reverse proxy
# and runs no SSH server, so the affected code path is never reached in this
# deployment. The package is linked into the binary transitively.
#
# Not patchable from here: the newest published image (caddy:2-alpine, v2.11.4)
# still ships x/crypto v0.52.0, and the fix is in 0.55.0. Verified by pulling
# the latest base and rescanning.
#
# REVIEW BY 2026-11-30, with the rest of this file.
CVE-2026-56854 exp:2026-11-30
